<p>NOTE: The Company completed its acquisition of Big B, Inc. (&quot;Big B&quot;), a drugstore retailer formerly headquartered in Bessemer, Alabama, during the third quarter and recorded a previously announced non-recurring charge of $31.0 million ($18.6 million after tax, or $.27 per share) in the quarter for one-time costs associated with the acquisition.</p>
